name: Source overview, recorded inputs and exact options without losing the draft
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME PATH=@ART/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_sections.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign owned-engine-inputs
require-live-snap: 25 owned-engine-inputs | frozen-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | plan-form
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | source-overview-120x36
expect-not: maxInventoryFiles
expect-not: semgrep: located at
expect: Tab Inputs
keys: z
require-live-snap: 5 Source and context: Overview | source-reader-overview-120x36
expect: Source content:
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 5 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | source-reader-inputs-120x36
expect: semgrep: located at
expect: Recorded content:
expect: Tab Settings
expect-not: maxInventoryFiles
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 5 PREPARED SETTINGS | source-reader-settings-120x36
expect: Tab JSON
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 5 EXACT PREPARED OPTIONS | source-reader-options-120x36
expect: maxInventoryFiles
expect: Tab Overview
keys: BTab BTab
require-live-snap: 5 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | returned-inputs
keys: z
require-live-snap: 5 PLAN A STUDY | returned-form
expect: RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS
expect: Tab Settings
keys: BTab
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | returned-overview
ask: Are source identity, recorded engine facts and exact options visibly distinct, with full values accessible and each tab returning to its retained position?
keys: z
resize: 160x48
keys: Home
live-snap: source-overview-160x48
keys: Tab Home
live-snap: source-inputs-160x48
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-160x48
keys: Tab Home
resize: 96x89
keys: Home
live-snap: source-overview-96x89
keys: Tab Home
live-snap: source-inputs-96x89
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-96x89
keys: Tab Home
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
live-snap: source-overview-80x24
keys: Tab Home
live-snap: source-inputs-80x24
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-80x24
keys: Tab Home
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
live-snap: source-overview-60x20
keys: Tab Home
live-snap: source-inputs-60x20
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-60x20
keys: Tab Home
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: source-overview-40x12
keys: Tab Home
live-snap: source-inputs-40x12
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-40x12
keys: Tab Home
keys: Tab Home
require-live-snap: 5 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | source-inputs-paged-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-inputs-page-1-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-inputs-page-2-40x12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-inputs-page-3-40x12
keys: Tab Tab Home
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-0
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-1
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-2
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-3
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-4
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-5
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-6
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-7
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-8
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-9
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-10
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-11
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-12
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-13
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-14
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-15
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-16
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-17
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-18
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-19
keys: PgDn
live-snap: source-options-page-40x12-20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_sections.py @TMP_TARGET @ART inspect
ask: At every viewport, can the operator switch and read these sections, inspect the complete prepared options and return without changing source, approval, jobs or spending?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME PATH=@ART/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | no-color-ready
submit: campaign owned-engine-inputs
require-live-snap: 25 owned-engine-inputs | no-color-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | no-color-form
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 5 SOURCE OVERVIEW | no-color-overview
keys: Tab z
require-live-snap: 5 RECORDED ENGINE INPUTS | no-color-inputs
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 5 PREPARED SETTINGS | source-reader-settings-120x36
expect: Tab JSON
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 5 EXACT PREPARED OPTIONS | no-color-options
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/source_sections.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recover
ask: Does restart retain the same unapproved plan and honest omissions, with all Source views available without color or additional work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
